OL,3,GNEWSARhun ap Iorwerth told he has 'no
OL,4,Amandate on independence' by Reform at
OL,5,ASenedd questions
OL,6,
OL,7,FRhun ap Iorwerth was grilled by
OL,8,Fopposition parties in the Senedd for
OL,9,FFirst Minister's Questions
OL,11,FReform deputy Welsh leader Helen Jenner
OL,12,Ftold the first minister he has "no
OL,13,Fmandate" to break up the UK after his
OL,14,Fmeeting with pro-independence leaders
OL,16,FWelsh Tory leader Darren Millar said ap
OL,17,FIorwerth should focus on fixing the
OL,18,FWelsh NHS "instead of hatching plans to
OL,19,Fbreak apart the UK"
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
