OL,3,GNEWSARhun ap Iorwerth told he has 'no
OL,4,Amandate on independence' by Reform at
OL,5,ASenedd questions
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt came a day after he joined the first
OL,8,Fministers of Scotland and Northern
OL,9,FIreland to declare that the UK
OL,10,Fgovernment's time "is coming to an
OL,11,Fend", and agree to help each other with
OL,12,Fconstitutional reforms
OL,14,FThe Senedd returned after an eight-week
OL,15,Fsummer break in which parts of Wales
OL,16,Fwere hit with wildfires, and the
OL,17,Fcountry fell behind other UK countries
OL,18,Fwith Pisa education results
